  "instructions": [
    "Combine buckwheat flour, salt, and black pepper in a mixing bowl.",
    "In a separate bowl whisk coconut oil, eggs, garlic, ginger, lemongrass, coconut aminos, fish sauce, sugar, and lime juice.",
    "Add the wet ingredients to the dry ingredients and mix until a dough forms.",
    "Knead the dough for 5 minutes and rest for 30 minutes.",
    "Divide the dough into 4 equal pieces and roll each piece into a thin sheet using a rolling pin.",
    "Cut the sheets into thin noodles and set aside.",
    "Heat sesame oil in a wok or large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the noodles and cook for 2-3 minutes or until crispy and golden brown.",
    "Remove the noodles from the wok and drizzle with honey, sprinkle with sesame seeds, and garnish with cilantro, almonds, and fried shallots.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
